toytoolkit: let the compositor draw the window's frame

Ask for server-side decorations (xdg-decoration) where the compositor
offers them, and draw no frame of the toolkit's own when it agrees -- as
for a fullscreen window. The Sirius desktop draws every window's title bar
and border, with Dear ImGui; without this, weston's clients would have two.

